  "definition": "Standard or Optional Surviving Spouse Tax Credits",
  "effectiveDate": "2016-10-28",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 400) #9309, eff 10-30-08; ss by #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 406.02)",
